      "lines": [
        "图164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数学中已证明，$\\pi$的数值是无限小数：",
        "$\\pi=3.14159\\ldots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算时，一般把$\\pi$的值精确到百分位：$\\pi\\approx3.14$，或用分",
        "数表示：",
        "$\\frac{22}{7}=3.1428\\ldots$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1122",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1122. 半径分别等于24厘米，4.7分米，18.5米，求圆周长. 数",
        "$\\pi$精确到百分位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1123",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1123. 如果半径长分别等于8.51米，5.62分米，圆周长各为",
        "多少？$\\pi$的值和计算结果都精确到百分位."
      ]
    },
